# 📊 Automated ML Pipelines & Model Serving

## 📌 Author
Astrid Yuan

---

## 🧾 Project Overview
This project demonstrates the end-to-end workflow of building, comparing, and deploying machine learning models for a classification problem. The goal is to predict whether an individual earns more than $50K annually using the Adult Income dataset.

Two approaches were compared:
- **Low-code workflow (PyCaret)** for rapid model discovery
- **Manual workflow (scikit-learn)** for full control and transparency

The best-performing model was then deployed as a web service using FastAPI.

---

